### Email Template Usage

```html
{{#if ADR_SECTION}}
<div class="section">
  <h3>🏛️ Architecture Decision Records ({{ADR_COUNT}})</h3>
  {{#each ADR_FILES}}
  <div class="file-item">
    <span class="file-name">{{this.name}}</span>
    {{#if this.url}}
    <a href="{{this.url}}" class="view-link">View Document</a>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/each}}
</div>
{{/if}}
```

This creates a conditional section that only appears when ADRs are updated, shows the count, lists each file with its name, and includes a direct link to the published document on AWS Amplify.

