[.github/templates/README.md#data-structure-example]

#### Data Structure Example

The notification script should provide data in this format:

```javascript
{
  "ADR_SECTION": true,
  "ADR_COUNT": 2,
  "ADR_FILES": [
    {
      "name": "ADR-001-microservices-architecture.md",
      "url": "https://eap-docs.amplifyapp.com/decisions/adr-001-microservices-architecture"
    },
    {
      "name": "ADR-002-api-gateway-selection.md",
      "url": "https://eap-docs.amplifyapp.com/decisions/adr-002-api-gateway-selection"
    }
  ],
  "PUBLISHER_URL": "https://eap-docs.amplifyapp.com",
  "PUBLISHER_NAME": "Enterprise Architecture Portal"
}
```
